Package: goodbyedpi-ebpf
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, iproute2
Suggests: bpftool
Description: DPI bypass on Linux TC eBPF with a Rust daemon
 GoodByeDPI eBPF bypasses DPI using TC egress/ingress eBPF programs and a
 Rust userspace daemon that injects split, OOB, fake, TLS record split,
 disorder and IP-fragmented packets.
 .
 The goodbyedpi CLI controls the daemon, validates profiles, hot-reloads
 them and diagnoses startup failures (goodbyedpi doctor).
